    11	 * deploy targets. The broker's orchestration is reused untouched.
    12	 *
    13	 *   # run it (TS directly)
    14	 *   npx tsx packages/gateway/src/server.ts
    15	 *   # or, in the image
    16	 *   npm start
    17	 *
    18	 *   curl -s localhost:8787/health
    19	 *   curl -s localhost:8787/fetch -XPOST -H'content-type: application/json' \
    20	 *       -d '{"url":"https://api.example.com/wire/42"}'
    21	 *   curl -s localhost:8787/audit
