    90	/**
    91	 * Build the Rail from env. The default (and only, today) is the self-402
    92	 * facilitator: a `SelfHosted402Rail` that signs a spend mandate with a
    93	 * broker-held Ed25519 key and commits it to an in-process `SettlementServer`
